    <summary>A desktop web server for smart devs. Develop locally. Demo publicly. Done effortlessly.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[A desktop web server for smart devs. Develop locally. Demo publicly. Done effortlessly.

## Features

- **Visual web servers**: create and manage web servers with a beautiful GUI.
- **Persist multiple servers**: save server settings for instant recall later on.
- **One-click sharing**: create a secure public link to share your local work with colleagues and clients.
- **Realtime configuration**: update server settings with simple toggles.
- **Intuitive CLI / API**: automate server creation and configuration programmatically.
- **Remote imports**: import code from the cloud directly into Fenix.
]]></description>
